Short:        LaTeX files from C++ and C sources
Author:       Norbert Kiesel, Joerg Heitkoetter, ported by Lars M. Nordeide
Uploader:     polluks sdf lonestar org (Stefan Haubenthal)
Type:         dev/c
Version:      2.0, Patchlevel 0, Release 4
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This is an Amiga port of c++2latex V2.00. The port
is done with SAS/C V6.58.

c++2latex is a tool for generating LaTeX sources 
from ANSI-C or C++ programs. It recognizes all keywords,
strings and comments. It produces a very nice output.
